'''Fallen Stars''' are randomly occurring events in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} that spawn {{MobSprite|Star Sentry;Star Sentries}} and increase ore drops.

== Mechanics ==
The '''Fallen Star''' is an event that lasts roughly {{Green|5}} minutes and {{Green|40}} seconds. A '''Fallen Star''' will crash in one of the following locations, causing {{MobSprite|Star Sentry;Star Sentries}} to spawn around it.
*{{zone|Royal Mines}}
*{{zone|Far Reserve}}
*{{zone|Goblin Burrows}}
*{{zone|Upper Mines}}
*{{zone|Rampart's Quarry}}
*{{zone|Great Ice Wall}}
*{{zone|Cliffside Veins}}

'''Fallen Stars''' increase [[Ore]] and {{Mithril Powder}} drops by an additive {{Green|+2}} per block mined.

While random, the odds of '''Fallen Stars''' spawning can be boosted by the perk [[Heart of the Mountain#Perks List|{{AN|Luck of the Cave}}]].

