== Trivia ==
*A special animation will be played prior to the star crash, starting near the [[Dwarven Mines|Purple Crystal]] in the {{zone|Cliffside Veins}}, where one of the orbiting stars will go off-course and travel towards its crash location.
* The [[2x Powder]] event works on the powder bonus.
* The ore drop increase is not multiplied by {{Stat|Mining Fortune}}, [[Mining Fiesta]] or [[Heart of the Mountain|Sky Mall's]] {{Green|5x}} [[Titanium]], being an additive bonus added after all drop multipliers {{InfoNeeded}}.
* {{Item|Refined Mineral}} and {{Ench|Compact}} drops are tripled by the '''Fallen Star'''.
** It remains unclear as to why the perk description does not reflect this.

